== Notes ==

* Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
* The spell hits upon a successful check: d20 + caster [[ability modifier]] + [[caster level]] + 10 vs. [[armor class]].
* For this check, casters with wizard levels use their [[intelligence]] modifier, and all other casters use [[charisma]].
* While the bonus to saves from [[spellcraft]] usually does not apply to spells with a duration, it does apply to (only) the first save rolled against this spell (as that occurs as the spell is cast, rather than after a delay).

